{"node_id": "nd002", "text": "To feel competent", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd010", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.75, "confidence_raw": 0.75, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I feel like I barely scraped by.", "char_start": 91, "char_end": 123}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I didn't expect them to be this good. But honestly, I feel like I barely scraped by.", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 123}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I just feel like all my hard work should have paid off more. I expected to bomb the exam. It's weird how things turned out.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 123}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I just feel like all my hard work should have paid off more.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 60}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "But it still feels like I could have done better.", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 110}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Studying for finals was draining, but I felt like my efforts weren't noticed.", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 101}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Studying for finals was draining", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 56}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's just frustrating. I worked so hard on those finals, but it felt like no one cared.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 87}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s2", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "It feels like I always have to prove myself, even to the people closest to me.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 78}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Still feeling frustrated.", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 58}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Like no matter how much I work, it doesn't count. Feels unfair.", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 78}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's just always felt that way. Like my best efforts don't matter.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 66}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "My efforts feel important because they show how much I care about doing well.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 77}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "My efforts feel important because they show how much I care about doing well. But sometimes they don't seem to count.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 117}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s3", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "The material was really dense and I had trouble grasping it. I felt lost and like none of my efforts mattered.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 110}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Even though I know people see my effort, sometimes it still doesn't feel acknowledged.", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 121}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s4", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It’s like no matter what I do, people just expect me to succeed without noticing the struggle.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 94}, {"session_id": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s4", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Sometimes it feels like nobody sees it.", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 136}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261008T015046Z", "last_updated_at": "20261008T020113Z", "first_seen_session": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000293-sft7b_multi_mem-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 1, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 4}
